title: the linkstack
pid: 3fd8e46a-4fd6-4c22-9f49-3247541afc10
body: |2-
  C-c u or C-c U for push, C-c o _ for paste, C-c O _ for pop.
  The stack is a list of trees, the most recently pushed first: a
  tree of one note, which C-c u pushes, or a chain, which C-c U
  pushes. A paste uses the first tree, unless you pick another
  (see skg-paste-link).
